# --- R session junk ---
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
.Rproj.user/

# --- knitr / rmarkdown transient build artifacts ---
# (NOT src/cache/ — that data cache is kept on purpose)
*_cache/
*_files/
*.knit.md
*.utf8.md

# --- OS junk ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- scratch / throwaway inspection files (prefix with _) ---
_*
